WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.071
Across South Asia, accessing basic healthcare is an agonizing crisis. For parents watching a child suffer from severe
fever and blistering rash, or families desperately seeking blood during emergency surgery, delays are fatal. Fragmented steps cost lives.

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.178
This is why we built ShasthoSetu AI.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:29.847
A unified, multilingual platform designed to bridge diagnostic delays, connecting
patients, doctors, and responsible clinical AI into one accessible ecosystem.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:41.212
Patients instantly browse verified specialists, review qualifications, and schedule
appointments in seconds, demonstrated here using completely isolated synthetic records.

5
00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:09.839
Our research pipeline directly targets major diagnostic bottlenecks. Model 01 uses XGBoost across eighteen clinical markers for early PCOS screening, achieving ninety-four
percent accuracy on held-out research data. Model 02 employs a ResNet-18 architecture to evaluate ovarian ultrasound morphology, providing objective decision support to clinicians.

6
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:26.665
In pediatric health, distinguishing measles from common viral rashes is vital. Model 03 evaluates viral rash patterns using rigorous
family-grouped splits to eliminate data leakage, while our pediatric dermatology module assists triage for vulnerable children in underserved clinics.

7
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:51.315
Handwritten prescriptions frequently cause dangerous medication toxicity. ShasthoSetu's OCR Studio extracts dosage, frequency, and warnings into structured
digital records. Crucially, patient confirmation verifies text accuracy only. Activating clinical medication plans strictly requires approved doctor authorization.

8
00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:03.926
To overcome literacy and language divides, Model 05 provides bilingual speech recognition, transcribing
spoken Bengali into editable Unicode text so patients can review descriptions before AI processing.

9
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:20.046
Our bilingual RAG engine fuses dense embeddings with BM25 keyword retrieval. Orchestrated by LangGraph,
it cites verified clinical guidelines while automatically intercepting medical emergencies with immediate 999 redirection.

10
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:36.526
Doctors remain the ultimate decision-makers. Inside the live telemedicine studio, physicians conduct
video consultations, review AI summaries, and issue authorized digital prescriptions with auditable consent.

11
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:47.417
In critical emergencies, Blood Connect rapidly matches voluntary
blood donors across Bangladesh, with strictly masked contact details.

12
00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:52.873
Built with role-based access, Zero-PHI support
barriers, and strict synthetic demo isolation.

13
00:02:53.000 --> 00:03:00.000
ShasthoSetu AI: responsible, multilingual healthcare intelligence.
Next, we expand towards formal clinical validation.
